@0    = ~You're as cute as a button when you fight, Saerileth. I wish there'd been more girls like you around when I was your age.~
@1    = ~Perhaps were there more like me, thou wouldst have walked a different path.~
@2    = ~You know what, that's probably true.~
@3    = ~But know that I do not appreciate thy calling me "cute". It is...not fitting to refer to one of Tyr's Chosen so.~
@4    = ~You said it, missy. "Not fitting" is my middle name.~
@5    = ~Thou art incorrigible!~
